<title>JAPAN: Japan August vehicle exports rise 0.7% year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan August vehicle exports rise 0.7% year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's vehicle exports rose 0.7 percent in August to 260,922 from a year earlier, the Japan Automobile Manufacturers' Association (JAMA) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>					    AUG	    YR/YR PCT</p>
<p>  Cars				  196,026	     -0.2</p>
<p>    Large				75,611	     -1.4</p>
<p>    Compact			   119,813	     +0.4</p>
<p>    Mini				    602	    +92.3</p>
<p>  Trucks				 61,480	     +2.0</p>
<p>    Large				47,626	     +8.6</p>
<p>    Small				13,844	    -15.7</p>
<p>     Mini				    10		  -</p>
<p>  Buses				   3,416	    +36.1</p>
<p>  Total				 260,922	     +0.7</p>
<p>Exports by destination:   Asia				   46,782	     +5.1</p>
<p>  Mideast				24,118	    +89.8</p>
<p>  Europe				 60,825	    -10.0</p>
<p>    EU				   51,390	    -12.4</p>
<p>  North America			76,090	     -7.2</p>
<p>    U.S.				 71,361	     -9.9</p>
<p>  Latin America			20,060	     -2.4</p>
<p>  Africa				 10,311	     -7.3</p>
<p>  Oceania				22,178	    +11.1</p>
<p>  Other				     558	    -20.2</p>
<p>Exports by major manufacturers:   Toyota		    92,748	    +25.0</p>
<p>  Nissan		    41,095	    -19.8</p>
<p>  Mitsubishi		33,152	    +12.1</p>
<p>  Honda		     25,674	     -7.9</p>
<p>  Mazda		     23,714	    -37.1</p>
